        "id": 1152319
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-25T18:37:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ah, that was my mistake. I read it as \"Both I2C and SPI interfaces do not fully comply with the *TCG standards for SPI and I2C interfaces*\". Not sure if wording can be improved, maybe \"Both I2C and SPI interfaces do not fully comply with the *respective bus* standards\" to better identify the standards we mean here.",
      "parentUuid": "95d91d55_bd99cafb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 51,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "b3cdf3514853a425cf6df7af3aebbc555c5cfa9e",
